List and Combo Box Item Verification
Tool: Selenium WebDriver

Aim: Automate the process of identifying a list or dropdown box on a web page and determine the total number of items. Validate default selected value and perform selection testing.
1. Create Maven Project
1. Eclipse IDE Open कर.
2. File → New → Project वर क्लिक कर.
3. Maven → Maven Project निवड.
4. Create a simple project निवड.
5. Next वर क्लिक कर.
खालील माहिती भर:
Field	Value
Group Id	com.stqa
Artifact Id	Practical10
Version	1.0-SNAPSHOT
Packaging	jar

6. Finish वर क्लिक कर.

मराठी: Dropdown मधील Items तपासण्यासाठी Maven Project तयार केले.
2. Add Selenium Dependency
pom.xml उघडून खालील Code टाक.

<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">

    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>

    <groupId>com.stqa</groupId>
    <artifactId>Practical10</artifactId>
    <version>1.0-SNAPSHOT</version>

    <properties>
        <maven.compiler.release>17</maven.compiler.release>
        <project.build.sourceEncoding>UTF-8</project.build.sourceEncoding>
    </properties>

    <dependencies>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.seleniumhq.selenium</groupId>
            <artifactId>selenium-java</artifactId>
            <version>4.51.0</version>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>

</project>



मराठी स्पष्टीकरण:
- Selenium Dependency Browser Automation साठी वापरली जाते.
- Maven Project वर Right Click → Maven → Update Project → Force Update → OK.
3. Create Package
1. src/main/java वर Right Click कर.
2. New → Package निवड.
3. Package Name prct10 दे.
4. Finish कर.
4. Create Java Class
1. prct10 Package वर Right Click कर.
2. New → Class निवड.
3. Class Name sample दे.
4. public static void main(String[] args) निवड.
5. Finish कर.
5. Complete Java Code
sample.java मध्ये खालील Code टाक.

package prct10;

import java.util.List;

import org.openqa.selenium.By;
import org.openqa.selenium.WebDriver;
import org.openqa.selenium.WebElement;
import org.openqa.selenium.chrome.ChromeDriver;
import org.openqa.selenium.support.ui.Select;

public class sample {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        // Launch Chrome
        WebDriver driver = new ChromeDriver();

        // Open the website
        driver.get("https://demoqa.com/select-menu");

        // Maximize the browser
        driver.manage().window().maximize();

        // Locate the dropdown
        WebElement dropdown =
            driver.findElement(By.id("oldSelectMenu"));

        // Create Select object
        Select select = new Select(dropdown);

        // Count total items
        List<WebElement> options = select.getOptions();

        System.out.println("Total Items: " + options.size());

        // Display all items
        System.out.println("Dropdown Items:");

        for (WebElement option : options) {
            System.out.println(option.getText());
        }

        // Display default selected item
        System.out.println("Default Selected: " +
            select.getFirstSelectedOption().getText());

        // Select an item
        select.selectByVisibleText("Purple");

        // Verify selected item
        System.out.println("Selected Item: " +
            select.getFirstSelectedOption().getText());

        // Close the browser
        driver.quit();
    }
}
